{"seq":3,"slug":"unsloth-training-acceleration","title":"Unsloth 训练加速框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/llm-fine-tuning/methods/unsloth-training-acceleration","wordCount":1084,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"unsloth-训练加速框架\">Unsloth 训练加速框架</h1><p>当 LoRA/QLoRA 将微调的显存需求降到消费级硬件可承受的范围后，新的瓶颈变成了训练速度。一次 7B 模型的 QLoRA 微调在标准 HuggingFace Transformers 上需要 4-8 小时，而 Unsloth 将其压缩到 1-2 小时——速度提升 2-5 倍、显存再降 30-70%，且不牺牲任何精度。Unsloth 在 2025-2026 年迅速成为开源 LLM 微调的事实标准加速框架。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Unsloth 不是一个新的训练算法，而是一套针对 LLM 微调场景深度优化的工程系统。其加速来自三个正交维度的优化：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    U[Unsloth 加速体系] --&gt; K[自定义 Triton 内核]&#10;    U --&gt; P[智能 Packing]&#10;    U --&gt; M[内存管理优化]&#10;    K --&gt; K1[融合 RoPE 内核 2.3x]&#10;    K --&gt; K2[优化 SwiGLU/GeGLU]&#10;    K --&gt; K3[MoE 分组 GEMM]&#10;    P --&gt; P1[无污染填充消除]&#10;    P --&gt; P2[自动序列打包]&#10;    M --&gt; M1[分块交叉熵 Loss]&#10;    M --&gt; M2[梯度检查点卸载]&#10;    M --&gt; M3[RL Standby 共享权重]\">flowchart TB\n    U[Unsloth 加速体系] --&gt; K[自定义 Triton 内核]\n    U --&gt; P[智能 Packing]\n    U --&gt; M[内存管理优化]\n    K --&gt; K1[融合 RoPE 内核 2.3x]\n    K --&gt; K2[优化 SwiGLU/GeGLU]\n    K --&gt; K3[MoE 分组 GEMM]\n    P --&gt; P1[无污染填充消除]\n    P --&gt; P2[自动序列打包]\n    M --&gt; M1[分块交叉熵 Loss]\n    M --&gt; M2[梯度检查点卸载]\n    M --&gt; M3[RL Standby 共享权重]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化维度</th>\n<th>具体技术</th>\n<th>速度提升</th>\n<th>显存节省</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Triton 内核</td>\n<td>融合 QK-RoPE、SwiGLU</td>\n<td>1.5-2.3x</td>\n<td>10-20%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>智能 Packing</td>\n<td>无填充序列打包</td>\n<td>2-5x（取决于数据分布）</td>\n<td>50%+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Loss 分块</td>\n<td>动态序列分块交叉熵</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>60% peak memory</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>梯度检查点</td>\n<td>CPU 卸载 + CUDA Streams</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>3.2x 更长上下文</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>权重共享（RL）</td>\n<td>推理/训练共享模型权重</td>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td>模型大小的 VRAM</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"融合-triton-内核-消除冗余计算\">融合 Triton 内核：消除冗余计算</h2><p>标准 Transformer 实现中，RoPE（旋转位置编码）对 Q 和 K 分别应用，产生 4 次 Triton 内核调用（Q 正向、K 正向、Q 反向、K 反向）。Unsloth 将 Q 和 K 的 RoPE 融合为单次内核调用，并支持变长序列（Packing 所需）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 标准实现：4 次内核调用&#10;q = apply_rope(q, cos, sin)  # kernel 1&#10;k = apply_rope(k, cos, sin)  # kernel 2&#10;# backward: kernel 3, 4&#10;&#10;# Unsloth 融合：1 次内核调用（inplace）&#10;apply_fused_qk_rope(q, k, cos, sin)  # single kernel, inplace\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 标准实现：4 次内核调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">q </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> apply_rope(q, cos, sin)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># kernel 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> apply_rope(k, cos, sin)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># kernel 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># backward: kernel 3, 4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Unsloth 融合：1 次内核调用（inplace）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">apply_fused_qk_rope(q, k, cos, sin)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># single kernel, inplace</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对于 MoE（Mixture of Experts）模型，Unsloth 实现了自定义的分组 GEMM（Grouped General Matrix Multiply）Triton 内核，在 A100 上比 PyTorch 的 <code>torch._grouped_mm</code> 快 2.5 倍，使 Qwen3-30B-A3B 等 MoE 模型的微调速度达到 dense 模型级别。</p>\n<h2 id=\"智能-packing-消除填充浪费\">智能 Packing：消除填充浪费</h2><p>LLM 训练数据的序列长度差异巨大——同一批次中可能有 50 token 的短句和 2000 token 的长段落。传统做法将所有序列 pad 到最长长度，浪费大量计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>浪费率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mtext>len</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>×</mo><mtext>max_len</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{浪费率} = 1 - \\frac{\\sum_i \\text{len}_i}{B \\times \\text{max\\_len}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">浪费率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4357em;vertical-align:-0.996em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4397em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">max_len</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">len</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.996em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>在真实数据集中，这个浪费率经常超过 50%。Unsloth 的 Packing 将多个短序列紧密排列到一条连续张量中，配合注意力掩码确保序列间不互相&quot;看到&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>加速比</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><mrow><mtext>总实际</mtext><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mtext>数</mtext></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>→</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext>x（当短序列</mtext><mi>S</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn><mtext>）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{加速比} = \\frac{B \\times L_{\\max}}{总实际 token 数} = \\frac{2L}{L + S} \\rightarrow 2\\text{x}（当短序列 S \\rightarrow 0）</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">加速比</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">总实际</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">数</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">x</span></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（当短序列</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当数据集中 80% 为短序列、20% 为长序列时，理论加速可达 5x。Unsloth 的 Packing 默认启用且<strong>无污染</strong>——使用 xFormers/SDPA/FA3 的 document masking 确保注意力不跨序列边界计算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"长上下文训练-500k-token\">长上下文训练：500K+ token</h2><p>Unsloth 2026 年的重点突破之一是超长上下文微调。三项技术组合实现单张 H100 80GB 上 500K+ context 训练：</p>\n<p><strong>分块融合 Loss</strong>——将 LM head 的 logits + 交叉熵计算沿序列维度动态分块。每个 chunk 独立完成 forward + backward（通过 <code>torch.func.grad_and_value</code>），峰值显存从 GB 级降到可控的 chunk 大小。chunk 尺寸根据剩余 VRAM 自动调节。</p>\n<p><strong>增强梯度检查点</strong>——将每层激活值异步卸载到 CPU（利用 CUDA Streams），仅增加 0.1% 训练时间。原版 Unsloth 梯度检查点（2024.4 首发）已被业界广泛集成。</p>\n<p><strong>Tiled MLP</strong>——与 Snowflake 合作开发，将 MLP 的大矩阵乘法分块（tile）到显存可承受的尺寸，释放更多空间给 KV cache。</p>\n<h2 id=\"强化学习场景优化\">强化学习场景优化</h2><p>GRPO 等 RL 训练需要同时维护推理引擎和训练引擎，显存压力翻倍。Unsloth 的 Standby 特性解决这一问题：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>权重共享</strong>：推理引擎（vLLM）和训练引擎共享同一份模型权重，消除重复占用</li>\n<li><strong>时分复用</strong>：推理和训练交替进行时，空闲方的显存（KV cache / 激活值）可被复用</li>\n<li><strong>自动调节</strong>：<code>gpu_memory_utilization</code> 设为 0.95 即可，无需手动调参</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"使用方式\">使用方式</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from unsloth import FastLanguageModel&#10;&#10;model, tokenizer = FastLanguageModel.from_pretrained(&#10;    model_name=&quot;unsloth/Qwen3-8B&quot;,&#10;    max_seq_length=4096,&#10;    load_in_4bit=True,  # QLoRA&#10;    fast_inference=True, # 启用 vLLM 推理加速&#10;)&#10;&#10;model = FastLanguageModel.get_peft_model(&#10;    model, r=16, lora_alpha=32,&#10;    target_modules=[&quot;q_proj&quot;, &quot;k_proj&quot;, &quot;v_proj&quot;, &quot;o_proj&quot;,&#10;                    &quot;gate_proj&quot;, &quot;up_proj&quot;, &quot;down_proj&quot;],&#10;)&#10;# 后续使用标准 HuggingFace SFTTrainer 训练\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> unsloth </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FastLanguageModel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model, tokenizer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FastLanguageModel.from_pretrained(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    model_name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"unsloth/Qwen3-8B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    max_seq_length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4096</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    load_in_4bit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># QLoRA</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    fast_inference</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 启用 vLLM 推理加速</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FastLanguageModel.get_peft_model(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    model, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">lora_alpha</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    target_modules</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"q_proj\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"k_proj\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"v_proj\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"o_proj\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                    \"gate_proj\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"up_proj\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"down_proj\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 后续使用标准 HuggingFace SFTTrainer 训练</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Unsloth 通过融合 Triton 内核、智能 Packing、内存优化三个维度实现 2-5x 加速</li>\n<li>融合 QK-RoPE 将 4 次内核调用压缩为 1 次，MoE GEMM 比标准实现快 2.5x</li>\n<li>Packing 消除填充浪费，实际加速取决于数据长度分布，短序列越多越快</li>\n<li>分块 Loss + 梯度卸载 + Tiled MLP 实现单卡 500K+ 上下文训练</li>\n<li>RL 场景的 Standby 权重共享消除推理/训练的双重显存占用</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"lora-qlora\">LoRA 与 QLoRA 低秩适配</a>——Unsloth 加速的对象：LoRA 训练的完整原理</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../mlops-model-deployment/serving/model-serving\">MLOps 中的模型服务</a>——训练完成后如何将模型高效地服务化</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Unsloth 训练加速框架","id":"unsloth-训练加速框架"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"融合 Triton 内核：消除冗余计算","id":"融合-triton-内核-消除冗余计算"},{"level":2,"text":"智能 Packing：消除填充浪费","id":"智能-packing-消除填充浪费"},{"level":2,"text":"长上下文训练：500K+ token","id":"长上下文训练-500k-token"},{"level":2,"text":"强化学习场景优化","id":"强化学习场景优化"},{"level":2,"text":"使用方式","id":"使用方式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"DPO 与偏好对齐优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/llm-fine-tuning/methods/dpo-preference-optimization"},"next":{"title":"微调数据工程与合成数据","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/llm-fine-tuning/evaluation/training-data-engineering"}}